Package: micropoint
Type: Package
Title: Below or within canopy point microclimate modelling with R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ilya", "Maclean", email = "i.m.d.maclean@exeter.ac.uk", role = "cre"))
Maintainer: Ilya M. D. Maclean <i.m.d.maclean@exeter.ac.uk>
Description: Mechanistic modelling of microclimate at a point location.
    From standard hourly weather data and vegetation and soil properties,
    predicts temperature, humidity, wind speed, radiation and soil moisture
    above, within and below a vegetation canopy and below ground. Also
    predicts the body temperature of ectotherms from the modelled
    microclimate.
